mapping "K414B.1" source="K414B" target="45845003" relationship=partial_overlap effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source K414B SNOMED CT 45845003 (Swedish extension of ICD-10 K41.4). Target SNOMED CT 4164568
        (45845003). Athena ICD10 crosswalk maps K41.4 -> 4164568. The Swedish A/B suffix distinguishes
        primary vs recurrent hernia; SNOMED CT has no concept for recurrence status, so the clinical
        (hernia type + gangrene) concept maps exactly. High not exact-equivalent because the recurrence
        axis is uncovered and the source is a national extension.
        """
}
